WEBVTT

00:14.270 --> 00:16.170
Why not let it all end?

00:16.510 --> 00:17.870
Just come over here,

00:18.640 --> 00:20.370
and you can atone for your sins.

00:57.030 --> 00:57.930
Wake up.

00:58.560 --> 01:00.010
You can't die.

01:00.140 --> 01:00.960
You can't...

01:21.230 --> 01:22.789
The file! The file!

01:23.760 --> 01:24.740
What file?

01:25.720 --> 01:27.320
Just now, when I almost died,

01:27.450 --> 01:28.870
I suddenly remembered that my mentor

01:28.870 --> 01:29.810
once sent a file

01:29.840 --> 01:31.060
to the Archives.

01:31.760 --> 01:34.130
It contained cases handled by the Chief.

01:35.590 --> 01:36.640
Some of them,

01:37.090 --> 01:37.750
I remember,

01:38.060 --> 01:39.590
were about Nanqiang.

01:41.590 --> 01:42.390
It's said that

01:42.640 --> 01:43.789
thousands of years ago,

01:43.789 --> 01:46.759
the ancestors of the Zhang family
once explored Nanqiang.

01:46.759 --> 01:48.120
Deep in the mountains and forests,

01:48.120 --> 01:50.520
they found an ancient and mysterious tribe

01:50.870 --> 01:52.600
called the ancient Wupi Tribe.

01:53.150 --> 01:54.430
According to the records,

01:54.430 --> 01:56.039
they were good at using poison

01:56.039 --> 01:57.950
and manipulating evil creatures,

01:57.950 --> 01:59.410
turning them into puppets

01:59.430 --> 02:00.430
for their own use.

02:03.120 --> 02:04.190
So you're saying

02:05.430 --> 02:06.850
the poison jar mechanism just now

02:06.850 --> 02:08.850
was set up by the ancient Wupi Tribe?

02:08.870 --> 02:09.970
What's their origin?

02:09.970 --> 02:10.699
I don't know.

02:11.090 --> 02:12.200
No one knows.

02:16.300 --> 02:17.900
What are you thinking about?

02:18.810 --> 02:19.579
I'm wondering if Zhang Haixia

02:19.579 --> 02:20.780
also saw this file

02:20.780 --> 02:22.310
and came here because of it.

02:22.370 --> 02:23.650
His purpose is to find

02:23.650 --> 02:25.850
the Guwupi tribe deep in the mountains.

02:26.780 --> 02:29.110
If there really is
a Guwupi Tribe in there,

02:29.680 --> 02:31.810
and Zhang Haixia happens to find it...

02:32.840 --> 02:35.000
What if he releases these evil creatures

02:35.000 --> 02:36.630
all over Nanqiang?

02:37.030 --> 02:37.490
Then...

02:38.740 --> 02:40.540
Then everyone will be in danger!

02:41.180 --> 02:43.060
Zhang Haixia wouldn't be that bored.

02:43.060 --> 02:44.560
What good would that do him?

02:44.560 --> 02:45.520
Why wouldn't he?

02:46.060 --> 02:47.120
Isn't he a lunatic?

02:47.460 --> 02:49.720
Does a lunatic need a reason to do things?

02:50.280 --> 02:52.740
Zhang Haixia,
what on earth do you want to do?

02:53.890 --> 02:55.690
There's no time to think about it.

02:55.690 --> 02:56.950
Since I can't find him,

02:58.060 --> 02:59.590
I'll let him find me.

04:24.720 --> 04:31.370
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

04:31.650 --> 04:34.420
[Episode 32]

04:51.870 --> 04:53.690
There's a fragrance in this path.

04:53.690 --> 04:54.830
It seems safer.

04:57.120 --> 04:58.470
[Cui]

05:02.910 --> 05:04.100
This is it.

05:05.930 --> 05:08.400
This is the fastest way to that place.

05:10.110 --> 05:11.160
What place?

05:12.760 --> 05:15.330
The place where we can get true freedom.

05:16.190 --> 05:17.530
Let's go now.

05:25.100 --> 05:26.550
Smells so good. Smell it.

05:27.360 --> 05:28.400
Smells good.

05:28.570 --> 05:30.840
It smells a bit like my ex.

05:31.180 --> 05:33.260
Then why don't you call out your ex

05:33.310 --> 05:34.890
and let everyone have some fun?

05:34.890 --> 05:35.810
Go to hell.

05:35.900 --> 05:38.430
There's something wrong
with the fragrance.

05:39.250 --> 05:40.710
Cover your mouth and nose.

05:41.370 --> 05:42.370
Keep moving.

06:11.300 --> 06:12.360
Come on.

07:09.430 --> 07:10.620
Keep the formation.

07:12.000 --> 07:13.390
Suppressive fire.

07:37.950 --> 07:38.950
Help!

07:40.820 --> 07:42.000
Help me!

07:57.190 --> 07:59.000
Zhang Hailou is here.

08:17.300 --> 08:19.430
He's coming to kill you.

08:22.390 --> 08:23.420
Look.

08:24.510 --> 08:26.750
He abandoned you in the end.

08:34.240 --> 08:35.750
I'll go kill him.

08:37.390 --> 08:39.080
Only when he's dead

08:40.240 --> 08:42.460
can you rest in peace.

09:08.350 --> 09:09.940
Then what should we do next?

09:13.360 --> 09:15.220
Zhang Hailou is coming to kill me.

09:21.750 --> 09:23.080
Everyone, return immediately

09:23.080 --> 09:24.360
and find Zhang Hailou.

09:25.990 --> 09:27.040
Once you spot him,

09:27.360 --> 09:29.020
give me a signal immediately.

09:29.620 --> 09:30.480
Keep him alive.

09:39.050 --> 09:41.510
I want to kill him myself.

09:41.620 --> 09:42.170
Yes.

09:43.980 --> 09:44.510
Let's go!

09:45.460 --> 09:45.990
Let's go!

10:49.370 --> 10:50.560
Shrimpie.

10:51.000 --> 10:52.700
Didn't you say
the three of us would be together?

10:52.700 --> 10:54.500
Then let's be together forever!

10:55.200 --> 10:56.960
Aren't you curious

10:58.010 --> 10:59.770
why I killed the Mentor?

11:03.360 --> 11:05.520
Because killing others is boring.

11:06.120 --> 11:07.000
So,

11:10.170 --> 11:12.720
I wanted to try something different.

13:08.700 --> 13:09.500
Keep chasing.

13:23.080 --> 13:24.370
So many paths?

13:24.910 --> 13:26.310
Which one should we take?

13:28.870 --> 13:30.500
Let me out!

13:34.080 --> 13:35.020
Let me out!

13:35.150 --> 13:35.820
Let me...

13:38.270 --> 13:39.200
If you kill him,

13:39.200 --> 13:40.650
you won't be able to find Zhang Haixia.

13:40.650 --> 13:42.510
Do you still want to take revenge?

13:47.440 --> 13:48.370
Feng Huang?

13:48.400 --> 13:50.540
How... how did you find us?

13:52.220 --> 13:53.690
I heard explosions nearby

13:53.750 --> 13:55.270
and thought something happened to you.

13:55.270 --> 13:57.270
I hurried over and saw this bastard.

13:57.410 --> 13:58.340
You're fine?

14:02.440 --> 14:03.130
Go out...

14:04.270 --> 14:05.910
-I want to go out.
-Answer my question,

14:05.910 --> 14:07.430
and I'll spare your life for now.

14:07.430 --> 14:08.300
Let me out.

14:08.650 --> 14:09.620
Let me out!

14:09.840 --> 14:10.720
I want to go out!

14:10.740 --> 14:11.720
What's wrong with him?

14:11.720 --> 14:12.390
Is he crazy?

14:12.620 --> 14:13.620
Stop pretending.

14:14.270 --> 14:15.210
I want to get out!

14:15.370 --> 14:16.260
Let me out!

14:16.410 --> 14:17.500
I want to get out.

14:18.430 --> 14:19.870
I want to get out.

14:20.100 --> 14:20.890
I want to get out.

14:20.890 --> 14:23.490
What exactly
does Zhang Haixia want to do here?

14:24.130 --> 14:24.880
I want to get out.

14:24.880 --> 14:26.740
Is the ancient Wupi Tribe inside?

14:33.290 --> 14:34.090
Let me ask you,

14:34.840 --> 14:36.390
are there more black-furred snakes inside,

14:36.390 --> 14:37.360
and is the Evil God there as well?

14:37.360 --> 14:39.420
Is Zhang Haixia going to control them

14:39.620 --> 14:40.880
and release them across Nanqiang,

14:40.880 --> 14:42.270
bringing disaster to everyone?

14:42.270 --> 14:43.940
Black-furred snakes are nothing.

14:43.940 --> 14:45.330
And the Evil God is also nothing.

14:45.330 --> 14:46.930
Compared to what he's done,

14:47.070 --> 14:48.730
he's the most terrifying one!

14:50.740 --> 14:52.340
We will all be free.

14:52.370 --> 14:53.870
We will all be free!

14:53.890 --> 14:55.680
We will all be free!

14:55.700 --> 14:57.560
Let me out! Let me out!

14:57.590 --> 14:58.630
Let me out!

14:59.050 --> 14:59.940
I want to get out!

14:59.940 --> 15:00.990
I want to get out!

15:01.870 --> 15:02.740
It seems the situation now

15:02.740 --> 15:04.440
is even more dangerous than I thought.

15:04.440 --> 15:05.740
You can go out now.

15:06.620 --> 15:07.930
I'll go in by myself.

15:08.360 --> 15:09.160
Are you crazy?

15:10.030 --> 15:10.830
I won't leave.

15:11.130 --> 15:12.660
I won't abandon my friends.

15:15.820 --> 15:17.220
Why are you looking at me?

15:17.610 --> 15:18.670
I am a member of the Zhang family.

15:18.670 --> 15:20.170
Of course, I have to complete

15:20.170 --> 15:21.770
the Zhang family's mission.

15:25.600 --> 15:27.550
Although we don't know
where Zhang Haixia is,

15:27.550 --> 15:28.680
let him lead the way.

15:29.200 --> 15:30.390
As long as we can get in,

15:30.390 --> 15:31.500
we will find him.

15:43.230 --> 15:44.040
This way.

15:46.000 --> 15:48.120
Where are Big Pot and the Snake Master?

15:48.120 --> 15:49.520
Probably got separated.

15:50.080 --> 15:50.840
Time is running out.

15:50.840 --> 15:51.790
We can't wait for them.

15:51.790 --> 15:52.790
Let's leave a mark

15:53.120 --> 15:54.750
so they can find us and regroup.

15:54.750 --> 15:56.220
I hope they are safe.

16:12.670 --> 16:14.600
They're Zhang Haixia's soldiers.

16:31.740 --> 16:33.400
Their blood has been drained.

16:34.030 --> 16:35.940
How could there be such a bizarre way
to die?

16:35.940 --> 16:37.630
There must be something
deep in this crevice

16:37.630 --> 16:38.680
that can

16:39.120 --> 16:40.350
drain

16:40.460 --> 16:41.990
all the blood from a person.

16:53.010 --> 16:53.840
Keep it.

16:54.100 --> 16:55.160
It might be useful.

16:59.370 --> 16:59.920
Let's go.

17:02.170 --> 17:02.770
Let's go.

17:04.380 --> 17:04.750
Let's go.

17:04.750 --> 17:05.089
No!

17:05.530 --> 17:06.200
No!

17:06.200 --> 17:06.829
Let's go!

17:07.829 --> 17:09.069
No! Let me out!

17:09.740 --> 17:10.740
Behave yourself!

17:11.790 --> 17:12.660
Let me out!

17:21.970 --> 17:27.230
[Wupi Ancient City]

17:24.660 --> 17:26.849
This should be the entrance
to the Wupi Ancient City.

17:26.849 --> 17:28.940
Zhang Haixia and the dead soldiers

17:29.270 --> 17:30.470
should all be inside.

17:31.670 --> 17:32.740
I don't want to go back!

17:32.740 --> 17:33.310
No!

17:33.310 --> 17:34.070
Come here!

17:34.070 --> 17:34.720
No!

17:35.440 --> 17:35.790
Go!

17:35.790 --> 17:36.790
Behave yourself!

17:40.510 --> 17:41.270
No!

17:41.530 --> 17:42.480
No!

17:42.480 --> 17:43.480
Behave yourself!

17:44.140 --> 17:45.010
No!

17:45.510 --> 17:46.910
He wants to kill himself.

17:47.310 --> 17:49.240
It won't be that easy for him to die.

17:49.420 --> 17:49.850
Go!

17:49.850 --> 17:50.590
No!

17:50.890 --> 17:51.220
Go!

17:51.220 --> 17:51.810
Go!

17:53.000 --> 17:53.570
Hurry up!

17:54.090 --> 17:54.830
No!

17:55.350 --> 17:55.830
Go!

17:56.770 --> 17:57.590
No!

18:29.180 --> 18:29.850
Which way?

19:05.460 --> 19:08.060
These are the narrative murals
of the ancient Wupi people.

19:08.060 --> 19:10.860
It looks like
they were fighting wars everywhere.

19:28.110 --> 19:29.910
These are black-furred snakes?

19:30.960 --> 19:32.410
So this ancient tribe

19:32.640 --> 19:34.370
had been raising these snakes.

19:34.420 --> 19:35.880
They even used them in wars

19:36.220 --> 19:39.020
to seize the territories
of other ancient tribes.

19:41.070 --> 19:42.130
There's more here.

19:55.070 --> 19:56.810
This painting probably shows that

19:56.810 --> 19:58.270
the ancient Wupi people made

19:58.270 --> 19:59.730
a bizarre Evil God statue.

20:00.720 --> 20:03.220
After these little black-furred snakes
went into hibernation,

20:03.220 --> 20:05.070
they would put them

20:05.090 --> 20:06.490
into the Evil God statue.

20:07.590 --> 20:09.460
If an external force caused a shock

20:09.460 --> 20:10.770
and woke the snakes up,

20:11.960 --> 20:13.960
they would break through the statue

20:13.960 --> 20:15.020
and move together.

20:16.570 --> 20:17.640
It would look

20:17.850 --> 20:19.580
like the god statue came alive.

20:20.350 --> 20:22.070
But the most terrifying part is

20:22.070 --> 20:23.700
that these little black-furred snakes

20:23.700 --> 20:24.960
can mimic human speech

20:25.140 --> 20:26.160
like parrots.

20:27.220 --> 20:30.080
By controlling
these little black-furred snakes,

20:30.160 --> 20:32.090
they could make the Evil God statue

20:32.290 --> 20:33.220
appear to

20:33.830 --> 20:35.000
move and speak.

20:39.000 --> 20:40.460
There's another one here.

20:54.810 --> 20:56.110
Other ancient tribes

20:56.220 --> 20:57.820
all thought it was a true god.

20:57.960 --> 21:00.830
So they worshipped
and made offerings to the Evil God.

21:00.830 --> 21:02.030
Little did they know,

21:02.290 --> 21:04.000
this was all a conspiracy
of the ancient Wupi people.

21:04.000 --> 21:05.200
By creating a fake god

21:05.810 --> 21:07.780
and brainwashing others,

21:08.250 --> 21:09.220
they could control the surrounding tribes

21:09.220 --> 21:11.080
without losing a single soldier.

21:12.660 --> 21:14.590
Sure enough, the Evil God is a hoax.

21:15.460 --> 21:17.860
These ancient Wupi people were very smart.

21:18.140 --> 21:20.270
Let's see if there are any other clues.

21:22.070 --> 21:23.030
The more we know,

21:23.030 --> 21:25.960
the better we'll understand
what Zhang Haixia wants to do.

21:25.960 --> 21:28.290
Then we can figure out
how to deal with him.

23:16.180 --> 23:17.110
What's going on?

23:17.350 --> 23:18.330
Look at this rat.

23:18.850 --> 23:20.250
Its blood was sucked dry.

23:21.070 --> 23:22.530
It only took 1 or 2 seconds.

23:23.310 --> 23:24.770
I have a feeling that

23:25.740 --> 23:27.800
there is something else around here.

23:33.440 --> 23:34.250
Then where

23:34.440 --> 23:35.570
should we go next?

23:38.070 --> 23:38.530
Here.

24:03.740 --> 24:05.200
There's another one here?

24:24.330 --> 24:25.140
As expected,

24:25.240 --> 24:26.980
the big Evil God we fought earlier

24:26.980 --> 24:29.380
was the mother of the black-furred snakes.

24:29.960 --> 24:30.700
The reason why the large
and small Evil God statues

24:30.700 --> 24:32.700
could make the exact same movements

24:33.070 --> 24:36.010
is that these black-furred snakes
can communicate with each other

24:36.010 --> 24:37.270
and mimic one another.

24:41.550 --> 24:42.610
The actions and behaviors
of these 2 things

24:42.610 --> 24:43.470
are identical.

24:44.000 --> 24:45.600
They can control each other.

24:46.980 --> 24:48.380
The case from 10 years ago

24:48.880 --> 24:50.080
has been solved here.

24:50.410 --> 24:51.340
Come take a look.

25:00.330 --> 25:01.790
These ancient Wupi people

25:02.220 --> 25:03.310
gave their captured prisoners of war

25:03.310 --> 25:05.520
to a strange stone.

25:06.030 --> 25:08.050
And then this prisoner became...

25:11.240 --> 25:13.100
What is this? I can't see clearly.

25:13.770 --> 25:15.300
Why can't I scrape this off?

25:17.480 --> 25:18.610
Just now,

25:19.740 --> 25:21.340
were these black spots here?

25:22.290 --> 25:23.690
I remember they weren't.

25:26.510 --> 25:27.090
Right.

25:27.720 --> 25:29.070
They weren't here just now.

25:29.070 --> 25:31.000
How could they appear so suddenly?

25:31.290 --> 25:33.290
These black spots don't look right.

25:33.300 --> 25:34.630
He must know something.

25:40.180 --> 25:41.710
Do you know something?

25:43.720 --> 25:45.050
What are you looking at?

25:49.180 --> 25:49.770
Tell me

25:50.860 --> 25:52.190
what you are looking at.

25:52.830 --> 25:54.590
Or I'll gouge your eyes out.

25:58.380 --> 25:59.090
Nothing.

26:00.240 --> 26:01.170
My neck is stiff.

26:01.740 --> 26:02.740
I'm taking a rest.

26:03.460 --> 26:04.320
Zhang Hailou.

26:04.550 --> 26:05.220
Look.

26:21.960 --> 26:24.700
Is the wall... growing hair?

26:25.530 --> 26:26.740
What is this?

26:27.240 --> 26:27.900
Don't move.

26:28.850 --> 26:29.980
Keep your head down.

26:30.290 --> 26:30.770
What?

26:30.920 --> 26:32.050
Keep your head down.

26:32.430 --> 26:33.290
Whatever Li Pinrui does,

26:33.290 --> 26:34.190
you do the same.

26:46.060 --> 26:47.130
What is that?

26:48.660 --> 26:49.610
What is that?

26:50.160 --> 26:51.220
If you want to know,

26:51.610 --> 26:52.680
look up.

27:07.790 --> 27:08.720
My God.

27:33.810 --> 27:34.740
What is that?

28:15.900 --> 28:17.100
They can't be killed!

28:26.880 --> 28:27.740
Zhang Qianjun!

28:27.960 --> 28:28.890
The explosives!

28:55.550 --> 28:56.530
Little Taoist.

28:57.750 --> 28:58.480
Feng Huang.

29:00.720 --> 29:01.790
Little Taoist.

29:03.250 --> 29:04.240
Are you still alive?

29:04.240 --> 29:05.030
I'm fine.

29:06.530 --> 29:07.220
My leg...

29:07.250 --> 29:08.780
Feng Huang's leg is pinned!

29:11.150 --> 29:12.950
Don't lift the stone right away.

29:13.000 --> 29:14.460
Her blood flow is blocked.

29:14.660 --> 29:15.950
If you move it too fast,

29:17.000 --> 29:17.740
her leg

29:18.420 --> 29:19.620
might get paralyzed.

29:20.400 --> 29:21.790
Then... then what should we do?

29:21.790 --> 29:22.720
Do something!

29:23.830 --> 29:24.830
What should we do?

29:24.940 --> 29:25.530
What should we do?

29:25.530 --> 29:26.250
It hurts.

29:26.660 --> 29:27.330
I'll be gentle.

29:27.330 --> 29:28.190
I'll be gentle.

29:54.350 --> 29:56.270
Zhang Hailou.

29:57.500 --> 29:59.070
Since we were kids,

29:59.550 --> 30:00.700
you've always had the ability

30:00.700 --> 30:02.330
to mess things up.

30:05.740 --> 30:07.030
In this field,

30:07.050 --> 30:09.140
you're very gifted.

31:46.140 --> 31:46.940
Zhang Hailou?

31:48.160 --> 31:49.010
Zhang Hailou?

31:50.810 --> 31:51.340
Zhang...

31:57.880 --> 31:58.680
Zhang Hailou?

32:16.180 --> 32:17.350
You... you're dead?

32:27.550 --> 32:29.430
I'm finally free.

32:36.290 --> 32:37.110
Let's go.

33:19.480 --> 33:20.770
This is the place.

33:25.740 --> 33:26.440
Blow it up!

33:26.550 --> 33:26.880
Yes!

33:26.880 --> 33:27.310
Yes!

33:39.960 --> 33:41.640
Keep blowing it up!

33:44.010 --> 33:44.870
No need to look.

33:46.350 --> 33:47.410
He's already dead.

33:47.850 --> 33:49.530
He was just talking.

33:51.350 --> 33:53.040
How could he be dead now?

33:56.160 --> 33:57.420
It's Zhang Haixia.

34:01.090 --> 34:02.220
Where are you going?

34:02.240 --> 34:03.440
I'm going to kill him!

34:03.610 --> 34:06.010
Killing Zhang Haixia won't bring him back.

34:07.640 --> 34:08.400
Mr. Zhang!

34:09.070 --> 34:09.820
Mr. Zhang!

34:16.610 --> 34:18.210
Mr. Zhang can still be saved.

34:19.110 --> 34:20.010
He's dead.

34:20.350 --> 34:21.409
How can he be saved?

34:21.590 --> 34:23.320
Hurry up and pull out the knife.

34:25.840 --> 34:26.650
Hurry!

34:30.340 --> 34:30.960
Hold it.

34:38.940 --> 34:40.199
What did you put on him?

34:40.710 --> 34:41.610
This is snake medicine.

34:41.610 --> 34:42.719
It can stop the bleeding.

34:42.719 --> 34:44.250
He was stabbed in the heart.

34:44.340 --> 34:45.429
Even God himself

34:45.650 --> 34:46.980
couldn't save his life.

34:47.050 --> 34:47.780
Don't worry.

34:50.110 --> 34:51.620
God is here.

34:52.710 --> 34:53.520
Zhang Hailou?

34:56.480 --> 34:57.280
Zhang Hailou?

34:57.530 --> 34:58.860
You... you're alright?

34:59.170 --> 35:01.420
Were you holding your breath to play dead?

35:01.420 --> 35:02.280
It couldn't be.

35:02.570 --> 35:04.630
The knife went right into your heart.

35:05.460 --> 35:06.920
How did you manage to do it?

35:07.000 --> 35:09.010
Most orphans adopted by the Archives

35:09.010 --> 35:10.880
are not like normal people.

35:11.090 --> 35:12.460
My heart is on the right.

35:13.530 --> 35:15.530
And I lured the Snake Master here
in advance.

35:15.530 --> 35:16.680
My mentor told me

35:16.710 --> 35:17.840
that your snake medicine is very effective

35:17.840 --> 35:19.440
and stops bleeding quickly.

35:19.920 --> 35:21.000
You knew

35:21.150 --> 35:22.550
he would come to kill you?

35:24.020 --> 35:24.660
Wait.

35:25.280 --> 35:28.420
Doesn't Zhang Haixia know
your heart is on the right?

35:29.760 --> 35:30.550
He does.

35:32.290 --> 35:34.360
So that wasn't Zhang Haixia just now.

35:35.070 --> 35:36.340
It was someone else.

35:37.070 --> 35:39.670
There are 2 people
inside Zhang Haixia's body.

35:48.780 --> 35:50.510
And the moment he saw my mentor—

35:50.920 --> 35:52.060
only Shrimpie

35:52.530 --> 35:54.330
would have that look in his eyes.

35:54.920 --> 35:55.340
And then?

35:55.340 --> 35:57.200
Mr. Zhang needs to take a rest now.

35:58.820 --> 36:00.020
By the way, Mr. Zhang.

36:02.820 --> 36:04.650
We found this on your mentor.

36:07.360 --> 36:08.480
This snake is very special.

36:08.480 --> 36:09.760
It can store memories.

36:10.000 --> 36:10.940
Once bitten by it,

36:10.940 --> 36:12.300
you can see what it saw.

36:12.630 --> 36:13.920
It will tell you everything

36:13.920 --> 36:15.030
you want to know.

36:15.650 --> 36:16.510
Snake charmer.

36:17.150 --> 36:18.690
No matter how powerful your snake is,

36:18.690 --> 36:20.160
it's no match for guns.

36:20.400 --> 36:21.880
Have it find a way to escape quickly.

36:21.880 --> 36:22.300
Okay.

36:22.300 --> 36:22.900
Take this.

36:23.940 --> 36:24.980
Escape now.

36:31.090 --> 36:33.040
Why does your snake even bite you?

36:33.360 --> 36:34.420
Help...

36:52.590 --> 36:53.170
What?

36:54.510 --> 36:55.150
This snake

36:56.170 --> 36:58.260
is a relic of Mr. Zhang's mentor.

37:05.290 --> 37:05.650
Zhang Hailou!

37:05.650 --> 37:06.900
Don't worry, don't worry!

37:06.900 --> 37:07.500
He's fine.

37:19.340 --> 37:20.170
Zhang Hailou.

37:19.670 --> 37:23.070
[Mo Yungao's Base in Xiaojiang]

37:21.690 --> 37:24.090
The pitcher plant plan has been shattered.

37:24.550 --> 37:26.090
The Southern Archives' annihilation

37:26.090 --> 37:27.350
has also been avenged.

37:27.500 --> 37:29.830
Now I must fulfill my promise
to the Mentor

37:29.860 --> 37:30.820
and carry out

37:30.820 --> 37:32.820
a highly dangerous secret mission.

37:33.690 --> 37:35.610
This mission is of great importance.

37:35.610 --> 37:37.010
It will last for 30 years

37:37.760 --> 37:39.820
and is the top secret of the Archives.

37:40.880 --> 37:43.320
Unfortunately,
your current rank is too low

37:43.320 --> 37:45.580
to shoulder this heavy responsibility.

37:45.980 --> 37:47.150
Therefore, we cannot

37:47.150 --> 37:48.750
go together on this mission.

37:50.110 --> 37:51.340
If you want to find me,

37:51.980 --> 37:53.580
you need to work much harder.

37:56.380 --> 37:57.580
Only then can we meet.

37:58.610 --> 37:59.660
Meanwhile,

38:01.150 --> 38:03.150
please take good care of our mentor.

38:03.920 --> 38:05.040
Do not be careless.

38:06.380 --> 38:07.420
In 30 years,

38:07.710 --> 38:09.820
[To Zhang Hailou]

38:08.420 --> 38:10.550
we will surely meet again in Xiacheng.

38:11.630 --> 38:12.940
Take care and be well.

38:14.440 --> 38:15.900
Sincerely, Zhang Haixia.

39:56.990 --> 39:58.650
What exactly do you want to do?

39:58.670 --> 39:59.800
Tell me!

40:39.870 --> 40:41.130
Black-furred snakes.

41:21.580 --> 41:24.460
[Research Report: Black-Furred Snake]

41:26.760 --> 41:27.160
[Black-furred snakea are enormous in size
and extremely aggressive]

41:27.180 --> 41:28.290
[Visual and Sense]

41:28.320 --> 41:29.610
[Nerve System and Toxin]

41:30.920 --> 41:31.900
They're researching

41:31.900 --> 41:34.960
the habits and pheromones
of the black-furred snakes?

41:42.560 --> 41:47.500
[Deployment of Twilight Grass Drop Points
and Plantations]

41:49.400 --> 41:51.590
Mo Yungao has another
Twilight Grass

41:50.330 --> 41:52.580
[Drop Point 1] [Drop Point 2]
[Drop Point 3]

41:51.650 --> 41:52.690
plantation?

41:52.810 --> 41:53.370
[Drop Point 4]

41:52.960 --> 41:54.840
It's at the border
of Bailejing and the Bone-Washing Cave.

41:53.480 --> 41:54.730
[Border of Bailejing
and the Bone-Washing Cave]

41:58.030 --> 41:59.340
This isn't over yet.

42:26.070 --> 42:27.050
Go back to here.

42:28.920 --> 42:30.720
I need to go back to this place.

42:30.740 --> 42:31.630
What's in here?

42:33.650 --> 42:36.090
This is where it all began.

42:38.730 --> 42:40.610
Don't even think about using me again.

42:40.610 --> 42:42.670
Then I'll kill the people around you.

42:45.500 --> 42:46.860
You can try.

42:48.360 --> 42:49.530
You can't speak,

42:50.340 --> 42:51.480
nor can you write.

42:52.630 --> 42:54.960
You can't even die.

42:55.190 --> 42:56.960
You can control my body.

42:58.330 --> 43:00.260
But you can't control my mind.

43:00.510 --> 43:01.820
I'll do everything I can

43:01.820 --> 43:02.940
to destroy you.

43:05.630 --> 43:07.430
Otherwise, I'm just a criminal.

43:09.050 --> 43:10.590
We are one.

43:13.380 --> 43:15.010
We're accomplices.

43:32.940 --> 43:33.570
Hello.

43:36.360 --> 43:37.530
Mo Yungao, right?

43:39.590 --> 43:40.900
Your men are all dead.

43:41.500 --> 43:42.480
Who are you?

43:44.320 --> 43:47.460
Agent Zhang Haixia
of the Southern Archives.
